Delia!

1490
01:34:40,015 --> 01:34:41,433
Aku tak percaya kau ada di sini!

1491
01:34:44,394 --> 01:34:45,628
Ah, Charles.

1492
01:34:45,729 --> 01:34:47,481
Aku sangat senang melihatmu!

1493
