{\an8}<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ Keep on dancing, keep on dancing ♪</i></font>

1494
01:34:48,356 --> 01:34:49,674
Ah, Charles,

1495
01:34:49,775 --> 01:34:51,151
lihat apa yang terjadi padaku!

1496
01:34:53,653 --> 01:34:55,888
Ini kereta jam 22:13

1497
01:34:55,989 --> 01:34:58,140
menuju Alam Besar!

1498
01:34:58,241 --> 01:35:01,453
Semua naik  ke Kereta Jiwa!

1499
01:35:01,553 --> 01:35:03,558
{\an8}<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ Keep on dancing ♪</i></font>

1500
01:35:12,047 --> 01:35:14,281
Aku ingin berterima kasih
kepada kalian, para penonton,

1501
01:35:14,382 --> 01:35:17,159
atas semua dukungan selama ini,

1502
01:35:17,260 --> 01:35:19,304
tetapi ini adalah acara terakhirku.

1503
01:35:20,555 --> 01:35:24,083
Aku sudah menghabiskan begitu
banyak waktu berbicara dengan orang mati,

1504
01:35:24,184 --> 01:35:26,269
saatnya untuk mulai hidup.

1505
01:35:29,106 --> 01:35:32,425
<i>Aku ingin menciptakan kenangan
dengan orang-orang yang aku cintai,</i>

1506
01:35:32,526 --> 01:35:34,820
<i>dan tidak dihantui oleh mereka setelahnya.</i>

1507
01:36:50,896 --> 01:36:52,814
Ya Tuhan. Apa ini?

1508
01:37:16,171 --> 01:37:17,839
Ibu!

1509
01:37:28,266 --> 01:37:30,627
Aku mengalami mimpi yang sangat aneh.

1510
01:37:40,114 --> 01:37:45,511
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ I recall the yellow cotton dress ♪</i></font>

1511
01:37:45,612 --> 01:37:48,775
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ Foaming like a wave ♪</i></font>

1512
01:37:48,876 --> 01:37:54,956
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ On the ground beneath your knees ♪</i></font>

1513
01:37:55,057 --> 01:37:59,773
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ The birds like tender babies in your hands ♪</i></font>

1514
01:37:59,874 --> 01:38:03,043
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ And the old men playing ♪</i></font>

1515
01:38:03,144 --> 01:38:06,793
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ Chinese checkers by the trees ♪</i></font>

1516
01:38:09,119 --> 01:38:14,486
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ MacArthur's Park is melting in the dark ♪</i></font>

1517
01:38:14,587 --> 01:38:20,416
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ All the sweet, green icing flowing down ♪</i></font>

1518
01:38:20,517 --> 01:38:25,795
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ Someone left the cake out in the rain ♪</i></font>

1519
01:38:25,896 --> 01:38:30,625
<font color="#ffe4ac"><i>♪ I don't think that I can take it ♪</i></font>

1520
